cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the tbg pipeline, also cite the software."
title: "tbg: Mapping Thailand's Business Groups. Ownership, Control, and the Finance-Business Nexus"
abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible pipeline that maps the ownership and control network of
  Thailand's business groups from public disclosures: Claude-assisted table
  extraction, Thai and English entity resolution, ultimate ownership with
  cash-flow and weakest-link control rights, pyramids, the finance-business
  nexus, publication-ready figures, an interactive explorer and an
  arXiv-style paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chongmankhong
    given-names: Thanatchon
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/thanatchon36/tbg-kit"
url: "https://thanatchon36.github.io/tbg-kit/"
keywords: [business-groups, ultimate-ownership, pyramids, interlocking-directorates, financial-conglomerates, thailand]
